@startuml 23_seq_host_detail
title Workspace-scoped host investigations
actor Operator
participant "Flutter host detail" as UI
participant "FastAPI" as API
database "Private PostgreSQL" as DB
Operator -> UI : Select host
UI -> API : GET /api/v1/hosts/{id}\nBearer operator JWT
API -> DB : Check workspace membership + host ownership
alt not authorized
 API --> UI : 403 Forbidden / 404 opaque
else allowed
 DB --> API : authorized host
 API --> UI : Host detail
 par History
  UI -> API : GET /api/v1/hosts/{id}/history?window=1h
  API -> DB : Membership + 24h bounded metrics
  DB --> API : samples
  API --> UI : chart points
 else Process snapshot
  UI -> API : GET /api/v1/hosts/{id}/processes
  API -> DB : Membership + latest snapshot
  DB --> API : up to ten entries
  API --> UI : processes
 end
end
@enduml
